# SM-T715 (armv7h) package of omarchy-mobile's omamobile-shell at commit
# 87b8395 (0.2.94), trimmed to the touch shell of an 8" tablet (touch
# layer P2, docs/journal/PLAN.md §3; docs/image/ROOTFS.md "Touch layer P2").
#
# What it is: ordinary Omarchy shell plugins (QML) that turn Omarchy's shell
# into a touch shell: a status bar with a pull-down quick-settings sheet
# (omamobile.bar replaces omarchy.bar), the dock, app drawer and home strip
# (omamobile.launcher), recent apps (omamobile.switcher), home screens
# (omamobile.home; OWL widgets stay behind upstream's omamobile-owl-widgets
# package, not shipped here), the keyboard's show/hide calls and language
# sheet (omamobile.keyboard), and the edge back swipe (omamobile.back);
# omamobile-setup-user links them into the user's config. Nothing here is
# compiled and nothing patches Hyprland.
#
# Kept as upstream ships them: the seven plugins above, bin/omamobile-setup-user,
# -launch, -osk-watch (keyboard visibility for the launcher), -bt-agent
# (quick settings' Bluetooth panel), -screenrecord and -widget, branding/,
# the widget guides and examples, the polkit admin rule,
# omamobile-setup-user.service (the image masks it: docs/image/ROOTFS.md).
# Changed for the tablet:
#   - profile/shell.json is tablet-shell.json (only the plugins shipped
#     here; the drawer at 6 columns; Omarchy's idle values, kept off by its
#     stay-awake toggle; Omarchy's 18 bar-widget-only plugins in
#     disabledPlugins, since omamobile.bar shows none of them and the shell
#     would still compile each at every start) and profile/home.json is new
#     (tablet-home.json: a 6x8 home grid with the image's apps), seeded by
#     the image build;
#   - 0001-tablet-quick-settings-tiles.patch: no hotspot, torch, location,
#     NFC, fingerprint or rotation-lock tiles (0004 puts mobile data back, 0005
#     the rotation lock, 0010 location);
#   - 0002-wifi-wpa2-without-sae.patch: the BCM4358 firmware has no SAE
#     (WPA3), so the Wi-Fi panel joins a WPA3/WPA2 SSID with a WPA2-PSK
#     profile through nmcli instead of Quickshell's key-mgmt=sae one (needs
#     iw, to ask the radio);
#   - 0003-tablet-quiet-pollers.patch: the home toggles watch the
#     notification service's settings file instead of a `qs ipc` call every
#     30 s, and the bar starts its modem and call watchers only when the
#     bar's cellWatch / callWatch setting is true (true in tablet-shell.json);
#   - 0004-tablet-modem.patch: the mobile data tile, through NetworkManager's
#     gsm connection and shannond's signal instead of the Pixel's
#     omamobile-sit.
#   - 0005-tablet-rotation.patch: the Rotation tile back, over t715-rotate
#     (docs/image/ROTATION.md), and a Rotate tile for a turn by hand.
#   - 0006-tablet-mobile-settings.patch: the mobile data tile opens Réseau
#     mobile (t715-mobile-settings) on a long press, or a tap with no connection.
#   - 0007-tablet-tiles-that-work.patch: Airplane mode turns the modem off too,
#     the Hotspot tile is back and shows its password, no Speaker on the call card.
#   - 0008-tablet-set-pin.patch: omamobile-set-pin says tablet, and sudo asks once
#     a password is chosen.
#   - 0009-tablet-back-gesture.patch: the edge swipe does what the Back key does.
#   - 0010-tablet-location-tile.patch: the Location tile over t715-gps.
# Upstream now does what three of our old patches did, so they are gone:
#   - 0003-tablet-drawer-opens-light: since 0.2.56/0.2.62 the drawer opens
#     with no icon rescan (refreshIcons moved after the slide, in settled())
#     and the search field takes focus only when tapped (an open that asks
#     for it needs '{"focus":true}'); the home screen swipes the drawer up
#     (DrawerLink.js);
#   - 0009-upstream-bottom-strip-keyboard-on-pill and
#     0010-upstream-app-names-in-recents: backports of 0.2.40-0.2.43; the
#     whole feature set (the one bottom strip with its reserved height, the
#     keyboard-down key and double tap, app names in the switcher through
#     SwitcherModel.js) is upstream and has moved on since.
# Dropped (phone-only, or replaced by the image's touch layer P1):
#   - plugins omamobile.fingerprint, .update (needs omamobile-update),
#     .access (camera and location permission sheet) and .voice (needs
#     Voxtype's daemon and a speech model; the launcher's hold-to-talk and
#     the Dictation tile degrade to "not installed" without it);
#   - bin/omamobile-fp-enroll, -nfc-open (and its
#     unit), -keys (t715-keys has the keys), -sleepd (and its unit; suspend
#     is masked on this tablet), -onboarding (the owner sets a PIN from the
#     menu), -portal-access (and portal/), -open-intent (Android links);
#   - the keyboard's language sheet pieces (bins -keyboard-languages and
#     -keyboard-theme, hooks/theme-set-keyboard): they serve squeekboard's
#     globe key and theming, which hypr/phone.lua binds and P1's own
#     squeekboard layouts and service replace here;
#   - bin/omamobile-voice, -voice-preview (Voxtype), -weather (and its
#     service and timer: the lock glance's weather, whose GeoClue path names
#     omamobile-gnss's socket and agent, which t715-gps does not provide);
#   - bin/omamobile-screenshot-open, -screenshot-edit and
#     environment.d/30-omamobile-screenshot.conf (the screenshot toast's
#     viewer is Loupe, from omamobile-apps, not installable on armv7h; the
#     environment file that would point Omarchy at them is not shipped);
#   - hypr/phone.lua (rootfs/t715-tablet.lua replaces it), the OSK pieces P1
#     already has (environment.d/20-omamobile-osk.conf, the fcitx5 drop-in,
#     squeekboard's layouts and squeekboard/generate) and
#     omamobile-osk-guard (and its unit): one mechanism per function, see
#     docs/image/ROOTFS.md;
#   - xdg-desktop-portal-gnome's file chooser drop-in and portals.conf, the
#     "AI Agent" and other desktop entries (applications/: the agent update
#     and intent entries, all phone-side);
#   - depends on omamobile-apps (needs neard, not in ALARM armv7h),
#     omamobile-owl-widgets (the OWL built-ins: optional and heavy, off),
#     xdg-desktop-portal-gnome, foot/xdg-terminal-exec, iproute2 and which.
#
# Source: the GitHub tarball of derekross/omarchy-mobile at 87b8395 (MIT;
# squeekboard's layouts, not shipped here, are GPL-3.0-or-later), checked by
# sha256; only packages/omamobile-shell is extracted.
# Build: tools/build-pkg omamobile-shell. Image: rootfs/install-mobile.sh,
# rootfs/omarchy-user-setup.sh; checks: tests/verify-rootfs.sh.

# Maintainer (upstream): Derek Ross <derekross@gmail.com>

pkgname=omamobile-shell
pkgver=0.2.94
pkgrel=1
pkgdesc="Omarchy Mobile's touch shell for Omarchy's shell: status bar, quick settings, launcher, recents, home, back swipe (SM-T715 tablet build)"
arch=(any)
url="https://github.com/derekross/omarchy-mobile"
license=(MIT)
depends=(omarchy 'omamobile-omarchy>=0.1.11' bash python python-dbus python-gobject
         qt6-declarative squeekboard jq inotify-tools bluez bluez-utils
         networkmanager iw brightnessctl curl pipewire wireplumber 'omatel-agent>=0.2.1')
optdepends=('wf-recorder: the Screen record tile'
            'khal: the home screen calendar'
            'playerctl: media keys for the home screen media widget')
checkdepends=(python)
install=omamobile-shell.install
_commit=87b839567ad77911e948a4549f84198549191a36
_tarball=omarchy-mobile-${_commit:0:7}.tar.gz
_dir=omarchy-mobile-$_commit/packages/omamobile-shell
source=("$_tarball::https://github.com/derekross/omarchy-mobile/archive/$_commit.tar.gz"
        0001-tablet-quick-settings-tiles.patch
        0002-wifi-wpa2-without-sae.patch
        0003-tablet-quiet-pollers.patch
        0004-tablet-modem.patch
        0005-tablet-rotation.patch
        0006-tablet-mobile-settings.patch
        0007-tablet-tiles-that-work.patch
        0008-tablet-set-pin.patch
        0009-tablet-back-gesture.patch
        0010-tablet-location-tile.patch
        tablet-shell.json
        tablet-home.json)
sha256sums=('e9b0f0522b56fe8575cb8f559081f51cf2b182b6ad9a6bdf9eee69def0fe1a73'
            'ca45666e11bb99c8f02f30a54e0cb50582b14e40eea31898f6b1d7b0f11441c5'
            'adb6f6e4c802ffb0b303ccbf35c56dcabfa24fa27cd70927ddae29f95dc25afb'
            '07c9d0428af5747d3e5a682d9ab5c00f89af493fb4e1d56d9df251719c39bcc5'
            '69d1a5b82d431249e8bd9cc85643f4d3e73f000abd82d3abab497b52bc611422'
            '34ae4a1f0dc78da42dd09b1113c136f78e7480a269293c934e31806f92945508'
            '3752bf657abbb55fae2fa09e552dc5308d68a6e38147181cd0b7f0422bcad9ad'
